Rene Reichardt (eney@cs.tu-berlin.de) wrote:
: Could someone please tell me if my character's sex is of any importance
: to the game, other than that only female monsters may lay eggs?
: Put another way, is there any reason for playing a male character?

: And I have this other problem:  Frequently after putting on a ring
: of polymorph, I receive only this: "You shudder... -More-  You die..."
: And my tombstone is marked "Killed by a system shock."
: Under what conditions is this bound to happen?

From my Several years of AD&D years ago, I assume the cause was a low
constitution value.  Or, a bad roll of the dice.  The Higher the
constitution, the better the system shock survival rating.  For
example, (from AD&D Players Handbook, (c) 1978) a const. of 13 gives a
survival rating of 85%, a const. of 16 gives a 95% rating.

